\f1\fs22 The Ablution occupied a narrow slice of real estate cantilevered off the underside of Modest Profit Prudential Tower. To enter, you descended a spiral staircase that corkscrewed through the building\'92s \'91ground\'92 floor and into an glass capsule suspended inside the Layer. The establishment\'92s brochure described the experience as 
\f2\i bathing at the edge of eternity
\f1\i0 , which was technically accurate if eternity meant a roiling grey-brown soup of toxic particulate that killed everyone who fell into it.\
